CLI.md §2.5, API.md V1: a --run that is no RE2 expression is refused (exit 2).
-- args --
test
--run
(
-- project.canon --
project acme {
  canon: "0.1"
}
-- a/a.canon --
/// A.
package a

test "t" {
  expect true
}
-- want --
[exit 2]
[stdout]
[stderr]
canon: value does not fit the type: expected an RE2 regular expression, got "(": error parsing regexp: missing closing ): `(`
